/*                                                                           */
/* The IBM i system values. Each is retrieved by name so that every           */
/* one the grammar knows is exercised.                                        */
/*                                                                           */
/* Member: CLSYSVAL   Compilable: no (the return variable is declared         */
/*         once, so its type does not match every value)                      */
/* Source: IBM i 7.5 Control Language, system values.                         */
/* Retrieved: 2026-07-28                                                      */
/*                                                                           */

